{"seq":3,"slug":"risk-management","title":"风险管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/asset-allocation/risk-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"risk-metrics","title":"风险度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/asset-allocation/risk-management/risk-metrics","wordCount":2234,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"correlation-diversification","title":"相关性与分散化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/asset-allocation/risk-management/correlation-diversification","wordCount":2293,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"hedging-strategies","title":"对冲策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/asset-allocation/risk-management/hedging-strategies","wordCount":2450,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"风险管理\">风险管理</h1><blockquote>\n<p>度量、理解并控制投资组合的风险——从波动率到尾部风险，从分散化到对冲。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"本章概述\">本章概述</h2><p>资产配置的目标不仅是追求收益，更是<strong>管理风险</strong>。本章覆盖三个递进层面：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>风险度量</strong>：如何量化风险？波动率、VaR、最大回撤各有什么优缺点？</li>\n<li><strong>相关性与分散化</strong>：分散化在什么情况下有效？什么时候失效？</li>\n<li><strong>对冲策略</strong>：当分散化不足时，如何用衍生品和保险策略保护组合？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"核心问题\">核心问题</h2><ul>\n<li>波动率是否是风险的完美度量？</li>\n<li>为什么危机时&quot;一切资产同跌&quot;？</li>\n<li>尾部对冲的保险成本值得付出吗？</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"学习建议\">学习建议</h2><p>先掌握风险度量的工具箱，再理解分散化的条件与局限，最后了解对冲的成本-收益权衡。</p>\n"}